Whats your name?
MC: My name? why do you want to know?
[signal arg="print"]
Nonody: Just say it!
label name_input
[text_input text="Please enter your Name:" var="Intro.character_name" placeholder="name" default="John"]
Are you sure, thats your name?
- Yes
	if {Intro.character_name}.to_lower() == "bill" or {Intro.character_name}.to_lower() == "mark":
		MC: I like that name
		set {Intro.answer_like} = true
	elif {Intro.character_name}.to_lower() == "yourmom":
		MC: Wow, how funny...
- No
	jump name_input
- no idea
	MC: I dont know
MC: Okay, thats my name, {Intro.character_name}
if {Intro.answer_like} == true:
	MC: At least i like my name
MC: This is THE BEST!